  <name>Chobi</name>
  <summary>Lightweight video player</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Chobi is a fast, minimal video player for Linux and Windows built on libmpv and Qt.
      It plays practically every video format FFmpeg can decode, finds matching subtitle
      files automatically (including Bangla), and switches audio tracks without restarting.
    </p>
